put.description:
Requires an existing account and an Ed25519 update proof produced by the
current account signing key. First-time setup belongs on `PUT /account`;
this endpoint never creates identities or vault memberships.

content_key_wrap.description:
Per-item content key sealed under the vault key. Always present;
clients decrypt the body by unwrapping this with the vault key,
then opening the body ciphertext under the recovered content key.
